Package: keyboardforge-linux
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: gatchez
Description: KeyboardForge -- Linux keyboard layout installer.
 Installer template for KeyboardForge's bundled fr_custom layout, with
 automatic Desktop Environment configuration
 (GNOME, KDE Plasma, XFCE) and Wayland/X11 detection.
Depends: xkb-data, libxml2-utils
